+# Plan
+
+## Constraints
+- Domain layer only: no framework or outer-layer imports (architecture tests).
+- Do not modify existing modules; reuse `BlockRecord`, `KnowledgeBundle` etc.
+- Deterministic output; no clock, randomness or I/O.
+- Each task: write test, see it fail, implement, pass. Code typed, ruff-clean.
+
+## Task 1 — slugify and section_key
+Files: create `backend/src/pharma_agent/domain/corpus/authoring.py`; test
+`backend/tests/domain/corpus/test_authoring.py`.
+Provides: `slugify`, `section_key`.
+Test: `Đường uống` -> `duong-uong`; max_length cut; empty path -> `doc#body`; nested path joined by `/`.
+
+## Task 2 — split_markdown
+Files: modify `authoring.py`; same test file.
+Uses: nothing from Task 1. Provides: `Section`, `split_markdown`.
+Test: headings/paths/ordinals, fenced headings ignored, preamble and headingless
+fallback, empty sections dropped, tables `t1..` across document, prose stripped.
+
+## Task 3 — section_choices and build_bundle
+Files: modify `authoring.py`; same test file.
+Uses: `slugify`, `section_key`, `split_markdown`. Provides: `AuthoredDocument`,
+`section_choices`, `build_bundle`.
+Test: labels with ` › `, colon-prefixed keys, sorted documents, counts in manifest,
+colloquial filtering, equal digests for repeated builds, write/read round trip.
+
+## Final
+Run `uv run pytest` in `backend/` and fix failures.
